// ROLLBACK PLAN (If Performance Degrades)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
// If live performance drops below 40% WR or 1.2 PF:
//
// 1. **Check Recent Trades** - Are specific filters causing issues?
//    - Review rejection reasons in logs
//    - Identify which filter is over-blocking
//
// 2. **Gradual Rollback** - Remove filters one at a time:
//    - First remove: ADX filter (least critical)
//    - Second remove: Liquidity cap (if market volatility changed)
//    - Keep: Asian block & HTF alignment (most important)
//
// 3. **Market Regime Check** - Has market structure changed?
//    - Gold correlation with USD/DXY
//    - Volatility levels (ATR comparison)
//    - News-driven vs technical-driven periods
//
// 4. **Full Revert** - If all else fails:
//    - Comment out all 5 optimization blocks
//    - Return to original strategy
//    - Re-analyze with fresh 90-day data
